# Generated site artifacts and source files are LF-normalized so the same
# generator produces byte-identical output on Windows and Linux (CI). Without
# this, running scripts/generate_channel_pages.py on Windows rewrites every
# generated page with CRLF, creating huge spurious diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
